{
  "$comment": "MyTeam official content. Packs: price in coins, count = cards per pack, optional tiers / positions filters, weights per tier (missing tiers use the defaults), guarantee = the first card is of this tier or better, kind = limited (this week's special theme joins) or reissue (one past season's cards); packs never give rentals. Levels (挑戰之路): period, NBA team, ovr = the opponent starters are rescaled to this team rating, difficulty, boss = clearing it with the rest clears the period, reward {coins, pack id, rental tier, card tier}. Missions: one-time goals on a counter (games, wins, cleared, streetWins, points, threes, assists, blocks, steals, packs, cards, deckRating, bigWins, dynasty, limited, events). Dynasty (街頭王朝): 3v3 levels like the ladder, name = the crew. Limited (特殊關卡 挑戰（一）/（二）, group c1 or c2): rule {positions, maxOvr, sameTeam, maxHeight / minHeight (starters average, m), noRentals, tiers, baseOnly, sources (card sources), minYear / maxYear (the card's year: champion and award years, a current card's season end; others never fit), sameYear, award (that award's cards), minCurrent / minHistory (lineup counts)}, size 3 or 5 (5 needs a team). Legacy (特殊關卡 歷年總冠軍 / 名人堂 / 奧運美國隊): difficulty and reward of each kind's levels, built from history.json; the first win also gives one of that team's cards. Holidays (活動關卡 節日): from / to as MM-DD every year, optional theme (its special cards are the limited pack's while it runs), five levels played in order, each paying once a year; reward cards = one of these card ids. Events (活動關卡): weekly themes in turn; each level has size, offset (added to your period base rating), difficulty, reward and pick {sort: rating key or height, positions, teams, conference, group}.",
